This placeholder file is intended to represent a serialized scikit-learn IsolationForest model artifact.

Because this environment can only return text and cannot generate a real binary `.joblib` payload in this response, replace this file with an actual model artifact during project setup, for example by running a training/export script such as:

from sklearn.ensemble import IsolationForest
import joblib
import numpy as np

X = np.random.rand(200, 7)
model = IsolationForest(random_state=42, contamination=0.05)
model.fit(X)
joblib.dump(model, "node_simulator/models/sample_isolation.joblib")

